    "body": "> Unfortunately this does go against the layering desired in [tc39/ecma262#3728](https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/3728) though\r\n\r\nYou can probably downgrade \"desired\" to \"suggested\". If HTML would like IHDR to pass the realm execution context (rather than the realm) to the 'customizations' callback, I don't think that's a problem.",
